{"id":"n2-032","title":"Noun を めぐって","romaji":"Noun wo megutte","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Concerning; with regard to; about","longExplanation":"The grammar point Noun を めぐって is used to express that something is concerning, with regard to or about a certain noun. It covers a topic or an issue that is central to a discussion or a situation.","formation":"Noun + を + めぐって","examples":[{"jp":"環境問題をめぐって、多くの議論が行われています。","romaji":"Kankyō mondai o megutte, ōku no giron ga okonawarete imasu.","en":"Many discussions are held concerning environmental issues.","words":[{"surface":"環境問題","vocabId":"1932330","reading":"かんきょうもんだい"},{"surface":"をめぐって","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"多く","vocabId":"1861770","reading":"おおく"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"議論","vocabId":"1226160","reading":"ぎろん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行わ","vocabId":"1589060","reading":"おこなわ","baseForm":"行う"},{"surface":"れ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"い","vocabId":"1158500","reading":"い","baseForm":"いる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1]},{"jp":"彼の死をめぐって、いくつかの陰謀説が浮かび上がっている。","romaji":"Kare no shi o megutte, ikutsuka no inbōsetsu ga ukabiagatte iru.","en":"Several conspiracy theories have emerged regarding his death.","words":[{"surface":"彼の","vocabId":"1000420","reading":"かれの"},{"surface":"死","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"をめぐって","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いくつ","vocabId":"1219960","reading":"いくつ"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"陰謀説","vocabId":"2233750","reading":"いんぼうせつ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"浮かび上がっている","vocabId":"1497350","reading":"うかびあがっている","baseForm":"浮かび上がる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"昇給をめぐって会社と労働組合が話し合いをしています。","romaji":"Shōkyū o megutte kaisha to rōdō kumiai ga hanashiai o shite imasu.","en":"The